<title>GERMANY: BASF confident to complete Kali sale soon.</title>
<headline>BASF confident to complete Kali sale soon.</headline>
<dateline>LUDWIGSHAFEN, Germany 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>German chemicals and drugs group BASF AG said on Wednesday it expects to complete the sale of a stake in Kali und Salz Beteiligungs AG to Canada's Potash Corporation by year-end.</p>
<p>&quot;We are confident we will complete the sale of 51 percent of Kali und Salz Beteiligungs AG to the Canadian group Potash Corporation of Saskatchewan (PCS) before the end of the year,&quot; BASF said in a statement.</p>
<p>The group earlier this month announced that is has completed the sale of its tape group BASF Magnetics to the Korean group KOHAP.</p>
</text>
